<title>USA: West Boylston, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</title>
<headline>West Boylston, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Markets said it won $8.250 million of West Boylston, Mass., general obligation school construction bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.2338 percent.</p>
</text>
